## Title: The Questing Guide
## Author: Alianym
## Description: A story-lover's guide to the original order of arcs throughout ESO. Set a keybind in CONTROLS or type /tqg and you're good to go.
## Version: 1.00
## AddOnVersion: 000100
## APIVersion: 101046 101047
## DependsOn: LibUespQuestData>=20250601 LibMainMenu-2.0>=40400

